pdf.body:



	${record.billaddress@label}
      	${record.shipaddress@label}





	${record.billaddress}
      ${record.shipaddress}



              Due Date: ${record.duedate}

              Document #: ${record.tranid}

              PO #: ${record.otherrefnum}

              Ship Date: ${record.shipdate}

              Ship Method: ${record.shipmethod}

              Terms: ${record.terms}

              Sidemark: ${record.custbody_pr_sidemark}

      Sales Rep: ${record.salesrep} : ${record.salesrep.phone}









<#if record.item?has_content>
<#assign total = 0>
<#list record.item?sort_by("custcol_pr_room_location") as item><#if item_index==0><#assign row=0>




	Item

        	 ${item.custcol_pr_room_location@label} 
	${item.quantity@label}
	<#if !record.custbody_pr_suppress_unit_cost>Price</#if>
	Ext.



</#if><tr style="background-color: <#if (row % 2) == 0>white<#else>#ededed</#if>">
        <#if item.custcol_pr_prod_url?starts_with("http")>

        <#else>

          </#if>

          ${item.item} 


     ${item.description}
  ${item.custcol_pr_room_location} 
  ${item.quantity}
  <#if item.custcol_robson_amt_w_tax gt 0>
      <#assign robRate = item.custcol_robson_amt_w_tax / item.quantity>
    <#else>
        <#assign robRate = 0>
    </#if>

${robRate?string.currency}
	${item.custcol_robson_amt_w_tax}
         <#assign row = row + 1>
           <#assign total = total + item.custcol_robson_amt_w_tax>

	</#list>
</#if>




	 
	${record.subtotal@label}
	${record.custbody_robson_cust_subtotal}







    Stock orders may be returned within 15 days of purchase. Items must be un-installed (no wires or chain cut) and in original packaging. Displays can be returned within 15 days in original sold condition. Invoices marked FINAL SALE are non-refundable. Special Orders from PL Partners can be returned within 15 days with no penalty, all other vendors will incur a 25% restock fee for return within 15 days. Special orders are non-returnable/non-refundable 15 days from delivery. Full payment is due at time of Special Order. A $15 handling fee will be assessed for any special order under $100. PL is not liable for delayed shipments and any costs incurred by those delays. INSTALLS must be paid in full prior being scheduled. Store Credits Expire in 1 year from the invoice date. Product Damaged/Missing parts must be reported to PL within 7 days. See Sales Person for further details.





    Signature ___________________________________
